{\pard\plain \s0\ql\sb60\sa60\f0\fs22\ql\sb50\sa50\cbpat11 {\f11\fs16\cf4 NEst = Not Estimable.}\par}
{\pard\plain \s0\ql\sb60\sa60\f0\fs22\ql\sb50\sa50\cbpat11 {\f11\fs16\cf4 a   OS (months) = (date of death or censoring \u8211? date of \u123?randomization/first dose\u125? + 1)/30.4375, and the 95% CI is derived using log-log transformation.}\par}
{\pard\plain \s0\ql\sb60\sa60\f0\fs22\ql\sb50\sa50\cbpat11 {\f11\fs16\cf4 b   Hazard ratio and 95% CIs are calculated using the Cox proportional hazards model / statistical method.}\par}
{\pard\plain \s0\ql\sb60\sa60\f0\fs22\ql\sb50\sa50\cbpat11 {\f11\fs16\cf4 c   P value for comparing the overall survival functions from the two treatment groups is from.}\par}
{\pard\plain \s0\ql\sb60\sa60\f0\fs22\ql\sb50\sa50\cbpat11 {\f11\fs16\cf4 d   Duration of OS follow-up (months) = (date of death or censoring \u8211? date of randomization + 1)/30.4375.}\par}
